WEBVTT

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:14.450
New Year's Eve.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:21.200
"MHK Speculative Song Battle"
"It's a battle, it's a battle"
<i>It's a battle, it's a battle</i>

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.700
"MHK Speculative Song Battle"
"Today I am together with you"
<i>Today I am together with you</i>

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:31.750
I love the song battle. Savu-<i>chan</i>'s the
only one who can close out the year.

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:34.870
Are you really Russian?

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:39.000
Are you both ready to go?

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.950
We're heading out soon!

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:42.830
Of course, we're all set!

00:00:42.830 --> 00:00:44.250
And a Happy New Year to you!

00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:45.750
No, no, not yet.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:48.450
We've still got ten minutes to go.

00:00:48.450 --> 00:00:51.200
Meanwhile, Tachibana-<i>sensei </i>is...

00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:53.370
Cheers!

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:55.830
Here's to spending another year single!

00:00:55.830 --> 00:00:57.870
Yay!

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:05.200
...having a singles-only drinking party.

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:43.000
"Episode 11"
"How Are You Spending New Year's?"

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:45.540
Hey, where are we going?

00:02:45.540 --> 00:02:47.540
Is there even a shrine around here?

00:02:47.540 --> 00:02:51.540
There is one! And it's perfect for us!

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:55.830
Ayaka and I met up early, so we
scouted out nearby shrines.

00:02:55.830 --> 00:02:58.250
And we found a great one!

00:02:58.250 --> 00:02:59.000
Oh?

00:02:59.000 --> 00:03:00.330
A great one?

00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:04.910
We're here!

00:03:04.910 --> 00:03:06.660
The shrine's up there!

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:11.120
So many stairs!

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:12.660
This is Masura Shrine.

00:03:12.660 --> 00:03:15.120
I heard it has a long history.

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:18.450
It must be as long as those stairs...

00:03:18.450 --> 00:03:21.790
The summit's covered in clouds!

00:03:23.500 --> 00:03:24.790
Oh?

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:27.370
Are they visiting the shrine, too?

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:29.580
Looks like it's all macho guys...

00:03:29.580 --> 00:03:35.200
The muscle god Takemasukuru
no Kami is worshiped here.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:38.250
Any muscle-related prayers
are likely to be answered here!

00:03:38.250 --> 00:03:40.700
That's one niche god.

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:43.330
Right? Isn't it perfect for us?

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:45.040
I guess?

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:47.540
Can't say I'm thrilled about it.

00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:51.830
Oh! It seems it's also famous for granting
wishes related to success in romance.

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:55.450
Even someone without a partner
will find one right away!

00:03:55.450 --> 00:03:59.160
All right! Let's get to that shrine!

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.910
First, we need to take on these stairs.

00:04:01.910 --> 00:04:03.790
We have a long road ahead of us!

00:04:03.790 --> 00:04:07.450
C'mon, think of it this way!

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:10.790
Climbing stairs is great exercise!

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:12.370
"Ayaka on Stair Climbing"

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:15.540
"Ayaka on Stair Climbing"
Today we'll talk about stair climbing!

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:19.540
Have you only been using the
elevator or escalator lately?

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:21.080
Hold it right there!

00:04:21.080 --> 00:04:24.830
Stair climbing is an excellent
way to get exercise.

00:04:24.830 --> 00:04:28.950
When you have the time and the energy,
why not take the stairs instead?

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:32.580
Here's how to calculate how
many calories you'll burn.

00:04:32.580 --> 00:04:35.950
"Ascending"
"Time x Weight x .0349 x Age Correction Factor"
Climbing burns calories like a light jog.

00:04:35.950 --> 00:04:39.040
"Descending"
"Time x Weight x .0658 x Age Correction Factor"
Descending burns about as many as riding a bike.

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:39.450
"400 Steps"

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:41.540
"400 Steps"
Climbing 400 steps burns roughly
the equivalent of a 15-minute jog.

00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:45.700
"15 Minutes of Jogging"
Climbing 400 steps burns roughly
the equivalent of a 15-minute jog.

00:04:45.700 --> 00:04:50.410
I recommend a stair climbing workout
if jogging's not your thing.

00:04:50.410 --> 00:04:55.790
By the way, jumping up steps with
momentum burns fewer calories.

00:04:55.790 --> 00:05:00.290
Keep your back straight and confidently
take each step one at a time.

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:05.790
Also, stay aware of your
surroundings in crowded areas.

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:10.500
A nearby staircase can be a superb form
of exercise if you treat it like one.

00:05:10.500 --> 00:05:13.120
Use it well and shape up!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.040
This is so hard!

00:05:20.040 --> 00:05:22.580
Just how many steps are there?!

00:05:24.830 --> 00:05:28.370
Ayaka's speed is what you'd
expect from a boxer...

00:05:28.370 --> 00:05:30.950
She's used to it from her
roadwork running routine...

00:05:32.080 --> 00:05:33.700
It's the shrine!

00:05:35.450 --> 00:05:38.160
We... We made it!

00:05:38.160 --> 00:05:39.160
Wuh?

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:39.950
Hey!

00:05:39.950 --> 00:05:41.000
Ho!

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:42.250
Ha!

00:05:42.250 --> 00:05:44.410
Macho guys everywhere...

00:05:44.410 --> 00:05:47.200
The new year begins with a familiar sight.

00:05:47.200 --> 00:05:50.410
Looks like we'll have to wait a while.

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:53.160
We'll be here all night.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.000
--Oh my macho!
--Oh my macho!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.080
There he is!

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.040
He's here!

00:05:58.040 --> 00:05:59.700
Who's here?

00:05:59.700 --> 00:06:01.540
Oh my macho... Oh my macho...

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:03.000
It's the priest!

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:04.700
Huh?

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:07.790
Oh my macho... Oh my macho...
Oh my macho... Oh my macho...

00:06:07.790 --> 00:06:13.200
Oh my macho...! Oh my macho...!
Oh my macho...! Oh my macho...!

00:06:13.200 --> 00:06:15.790
Oh my macho!

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.290
Oh, are you visiting your first
shrine of the year, too?

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:20.000
What the hell are you doing here?!

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.370
This isn't the place for a joke!

00:06:22.370 --> 00:06:24.370
You'll make the shrine owners mad!

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:25.950
You're mistaken, Sakura-<i>san</i>.

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:28.120
This shrine belongs to my family.

00:06:28.120 --> 00:06:30.500
I help them out around
the New Year's holidays.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:31.950
You're kidding me!

00:06:31.950 --> 00:06:34.160
Didn't you know?

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:36.750
Jason?!

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:41.790
In our world, Machio-<i>san </i>is
known as the Great Muscle God.

00:06:41.790 --> 00:06:45.660
He's actually a Muscle Priest.

00:06:45.660 --> 00:06:48.410
Doesn't that have a nice ring to it?

00:06:48.410 --> 00:06:49.410
"Priesthood"
And of course, he's a licensed priest.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:50.580
"Priesthood" "Musclehood"
And of course, he's a licensed priest.

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:52.830
"Priesthood" "Musclehood"
So it works out that he's part of the
priesthood and the musclehood!

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:54.830
Thanks for the explanation, macho guys!

00:06:54.830 --> 00:06:57.830
And no, Jason, it doesn't work at all!

00:06:57.830 --> 00:07:00.450
Do you really think our
prayers will be answered?

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:05.000
I was planning on wishing
for a boyfriend this year...

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:06.450
Actually, so was I...

00:07:06.450 --> 00:07:07.830
Actually, so was I.

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:09.120
Actually, so was I!

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:11.290
Don't worry!

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:15.040
If you wish with all your heart,
I'm sure your prayers will be answered.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:18.410
If we wish with all our hearts...

00:07:18.410 --> 00:07:20.540
...our prayers will be answered!

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:22.580
Specifically, you should wish from the area
around your pectoralis minor muscle!

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:24.450
"This area"
Specifically, you should wish from the area
around your pectoralis minor muscle!

00:07:24.450 --> 00:07:26.200
"This area"
Why does it always come back to muscles?!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:27.410
Now then!

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:29.450
Worship the muscles!

00:07:29.450 --> 00:07:31.700
You've already changed the subject!

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:33.830
--Macho-ho! Macho-ho! Macho-ho! Macho-ho!

00:07:33.830 --> 00:07:36.080
--Madam Hibiki, you and your
friends should join in!
--Macho-ho! Macho-ho! Macho-ho! Macho-ho!

00:07:36.080 --> 00:07:37.830
--Like hell!
--Macho-ho! Macho-ho! Macho-ho! Macho-ho!

00:07:41.830 --> 00:07:44.200
It's so pretty!

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:51.580
<i>Vkusno </i>[Delish]!

00:07:51.580 --> 00:07:53.580
"Ikayaki"
The first squid of the New Year is so great!

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:56.750
"Ikayaki"
It's the first shrine of the year,
not the first squid.

00:07:57.000 --> 00:08:00.830
<i>Ikayaki </i>is rich in taurine,
which helps reduce fat.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.080
I'll eat anything if it tastes good.

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:07.660
You should be eating in moderation.

00:08:07.660 --> 00:08:10.750
You'll gain weight again over winter break.

00:08:10.750 --> 00:08:12.500
Y-You're not wrong...

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:16.950
Still, I'm limited in how much I can
exercise during the New Year's holidays.

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:19.750
Right, since Silverman Gym is closed...

00:08:19.750 --> 00:08:20.290
--Machio-<i>san </i>seems...
busy with shrine stuff,

00:08:20.290 --> 00:08:22.790
--Sir Naruzo, bravo!
--Machio-<i>san </i>seems...
busy with shrine stuff,

00:08:22.790 --> 00:08:23.910
--So huge!
--Machio-<i>san </i>seems...
busy with shrine stuff,

00:08:23.910 --> 00:08:24.250
--So huge!
--so I'd hate to bother him with questions.

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:26.410
--So lucky! So lucky!
--so I'd hate to bother him with questions.

00:08:26.410 --> 00:08:29.330
Hold up, what part of that is a holy ritual?

00:08:31.120 --> 00:08:33.580
No point in jogging, either.

00:08:33.580 --> 00:08:36.080
Since we can just use the shrine steps.

00:08:36.080 --> 00:08:38.950
"Takoyaki"
And the pool's closed for New Year's, too.

00:08:39.200 --> 00:08:41.330
What's there to worry about?

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:43.620
You just want to work out, right?

00:08:43.620 --> 00:08:46.080
Is there a park near here?

00:08:46.080 --> 00:08:48.160
A park?

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:50.200
A street workout?

00:08:50.200 --> 00:08:53.660
Yup! It's all the rage in Europe
and the U.S. right now.

00:08:53.660 --> 00:08:55.790
It's also called a ghetto workout.

00:08:55.790 --> 00:08:56.160
"Street Workout"
"Human Flag" "Parallel Bar Dips"

00:08:56.160 --> 00:09:00.290
"Street Workout"
"Human Flag" "Parallel Bar Dips"
Basically, you work out
with the park's equipment.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:03.540
"Street Workout"
"Parallel Bar Dips" "Pull-Ups"
It's simple and popular because
all you need is your own body.

00:09:03.540 --> 00:09:06.040
"Combine these with aerobic exercises"
So it's essentially circuit training.

00:09:06.120 --> 00:09:10.160
I miss it. I did it all the time back in Russia.

00:09:10.160 --> 00:09:11.080
Uh...

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:12.660
"Uh", what?

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:15.080
It might be hard for us to do it here.

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:16.790
Why's that?

00:09:21.200 --> 00:09:23.330
Well, that's why.

00:09:29.160 --> 00:09:30.200
And then...

00:09:30.200 --> 00:09:31.580
Oh no, really?

00:09:31.580 --> 00:09:32.580
Yes, really!

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:34.080
My...

00:09:35.370 --> 00:09:38.040
Um, Gina?

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:41.040
This is just an empty lot.

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:43.250
It's not like any park I've ever known.

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:45.080
That was quite the build-up.

00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:46.870
Just how much do you like parks?

00:09:46.870 --> 00:09:50.870
Japan's parks have gradually had all
their playground equipment removed.

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:54.120
And more and more of them
don't allow exercising these days.

00:09:54.120 --> 00:10:01.540
I-I had no idea that Japan's parks
were in such a sorry state!

00:10:01.540 --> 00:10:04.830
This one has a horizontal bar,
so it's better than nothing.

00:10:04.830 --> 00:10:07.080
Which means we can do some chin-ups.

00:10:07.080 --> 00:10:09.870
Though I can only do inclined ones.

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:13.910
So we're left with stuff like push-ups
and running around the park?

00:10:13.910 --> 00:10:16.290
Oh, I know!

00:10:16.290 --> 00:10:18.250
I brought this just in case we needed it.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:18.660
"Read With Your Muscles!"
"A Dictionary of Exercises by Body Region"
"By Toshio Ozu"

00:10:18.660 --> 00:10:20.660
"Read With Your Muscles!"
"A Dictionary of Exercises by Body Region"
"By Toshio Ozu"
This book might help us out!

00:10:20.660 --> 00:10:22.750
"Read With Your Muscles!"
"A Dictionary of Exercises by Body Region"
"By Toshio Ozu"
Why'd you bring that on the shrine visit?!

00:10:23.580 --> 00:10:27.330
<i>A Dictionary of Exercises by</i>
<i>Body Region</i>, by Toshio Ozu...

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:31.580
This is like the last time we had
to train without equipment.

00:10:31.580 --> 00:10:34.120
Yeah, we still don't have any.

00:10:34.120 --> 00:10:36.370
Oh! I found it!

00:10:36.370 --> 00:10:36.910
"No Equipment Needed! Training at Home"

00:10:36.910 --> 00:10:39.950
"No Equipment Needed! Training at Home"
No equipment needed! Training at home!

00:10:39.950 --> 00:10:43.120
"No Equipment Needed! Training at Home"
Ugh, his weird poses piss me off.

00:10:43.160 --> 00:10:52.830
"In this chapter, I will explain how to
train without any equipment at all.
Even if your environment is lacking,
you can train depending on your ideas."

00:10:52.830 --> 00:10:56.040
"The important thing is not to give up."

00:10:56.080 --> 00:10:59.620
Solid advice, but the picture ruins it.

00:10:59.620 --> 00:11:01.790
Just who are you fighting, Toshio Ozu?

00:11:01.790 --> 00:11:04.080
So it's bodyweight training.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:08.040
Which means we're stuck with push-ups,
sit-ups, and back exercises.

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.950
Wh-What's this?!

00:11:09.950 --> 00:11:10.120
"A Massive 20 Pages!"
"Sealed!"
"The Hidden Side of Toshio Ozu"

00:11:10.120 --> 00:11:12.410
"A Massive 20 Pages!"
"Sealed!"
"The Hidden Side of Toshio Ozu"
A sealed Toshio Ozu centerfold?!

00:11:12.410 --> 00:11:14.200
"A Massive 20 Pages!"
"Sealed!"
"The Hidden Side of Toshio Ozu"
I really don't want to look,

00:11:14.200 --> 00:11:15.950
"A Massive 20 Pages!"
"Sealed!"
"The Hidden Side of Toshio Ozu"
and yet I really want to!

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:20.950
"Toshio Ozu"
"Training Without Equipment"

00:11:22.160 --> 00:11:23.250
Now then!

00:11:23.250 --> 00:11:30.000
Today I'll discuss how you can
train without any equipment at all!

00:11:30.000 --> 00:11:30.290
"Chest Isometrics"

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:33.080
"Chest Isometrics"
Right! First up, chest isometrics!

00:11:33.330 --> 00:11:35.830
Press your hands together in front of
you and apply pressure with both palms.

00:11:35.830 --> 00:11:36.330
"Chest out"
Press your hands together in front of
you and apply pressure with both palms.

00:11:36.330 --> 00:11:36.830
"Hands don't move from side-to-side"
Press your hands together in front of
you and apply pressure with both palms.

00:11:36.830 --> 00:11:41.750
"Hands don't move from side-to-side"
Hold for seven seconds at 70% of your
strength without holding your breath.

00:11:41.750 --> 00:11:41.910
"Back Isometrics"

00:11:41.910 --> 00:11:44.500
"Back Isometrics"
Now for some back isometrics!

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:47.250
Mesh your fingers in front of you and
