00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:47.540
"Chest out"
Mesh your fingers in front of you and
then pull them in opposite directions.

00:11:47.540 --> 00:11:47.750
"Chest out"
Hold for seven seconds at 70% of your
strength without holding your breath.

00:11:47.750 --> 00:11:53.250
"Hands located around stomach area"
Hold for seven seconds at 70% of your
