00:11:53.250 --> 00:11:53.580
"Pike Shoulder Press"

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:56.500
"Pike Shoulder Press"
And now to train your shoulders
with the pike shoulder press!

00:11:56.500 --> 00:11:59.370
"Tiptoes"
Get on all fours, lift up your butt,
