00:11:59.370 --> 00:11:59.620
"Legs waist-width apart"
"Hands a bit more than shoulder-width apart"
Get on all fours, lift up your butt,
and keep your legs straight.

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:04.870
"Legs waist-width apart"
"Hands a bit more than shoulder-width apart"
Bend just your arms without lowering your butt.

00:12:04.870 --> 00:12:04.910
"Bodyweight Arm Curls"

00:12:04.910 --> 00:12:08.750
"Bodyweight Arm Curls"
Yow! Work out your arms
with bodyweight arm curls!

00:12:08.750 --> 00:12:13.250
"Relax shoulders"
