00:12:13.250 --> 00:12:15.790
"Relax shoulders"
"Arm moves in straight line"
Keep your shoulders relaxed.

00:12:15.790 --> 00:12:20.160
"Relax shoulders"
"Arm moves in straight line"
Wow! So we can do so much
more than just push-ups!

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:24.040
Right! You can train anytime, anywhere!

00:12:24.040 --> 00:12:28.660
Stay aware of your surroundings and work hard!

00:12:30.910 --> 00:12:34.450
I see, so it's an isometrics workout.

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:38.330
It's easy to adjust the resistance,
so it's hard to hurt yourself.

00:12:40.250 --> 00:12:42.830
Bodyweight shoulder presses really work!

00:12:42.830 --> 00:12:45.750
I can push myself even without dumbbells!

00:12:45.750 --> 00:12:48.250
Bodyweight shoulder curls are good, too!

00:12:48.250 --> 00:12:54.620
Applying pressure uses your triceps,
so you can train them along with your biceps.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:59.410
Combined with chinning and running,
this makes for quite the workout!

00:12:59.410 --> 00:13:01.660
It's a Japanese street workout!

00:13:01.660 --> 00:13:02.870
Right?

00:13:05.410 --> 00:13:06.290
So, yeah...

00:13:06.290 --> 00:13:09.870
--I wonder who they are.
--Huh? You don't know them either?
--What are they doing?
--This area's been pretty shady lately...

00:13:09.870 --> 00:13:13.870
Since the neighbors have shown up,
we should finish this up ASAP.

00:13:13.870 --> 00:13:16.290
Okay.

00:13:16.290 --> 00:13:20.370
The current state of Japan's parks
makes it hard to train here.

00:13:22.370 --> 00:13:25.040
Aw, geez...

00:13:25.040 --> 00:13:28.370
Maybe training in the park
is a hurdle too high for us.

00:13:28.370 --> 00:13:31.000
Why don't we do it at our local park tomorrow?

00:13:31.000 --> 00:13:33.290
It's an athletic park, so we won't stand out.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:39.750
But we sure have a lot of free time if we
can train after a New Year's all-nighter.

00:13:39.750 --> 00:13:41.120
You're right.

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:45.830
Man... isn't there anything fun we could do?

00:13:45.830 --> 00:13:47.080
